-- Temple of Ahn'Qiraj (map 531, the 40-man raid): the plan for the run leader (.bot run), exported from turtle-agent
-- 8f42c87 (dungeons/temple_of_ahnqiraj.json, status 'draft (not mapped, not live-checked)') with
--   turtle-agent plan-export --dir dungeons --mmaps <map 531 mmaps> --allow-draft --gm-cross-direct --approach-hops \
--     --rev 8f42c87 --stamp 20261028190000 --out <this file> temple_of_ahnqiraj
-- NO ROW IS HAND-SET: the plan, leg and step rows below are the exporter's output; this header, the ai_dungeon_boss
-- block and the ai_boss_tactic block are the prep's own (task B1, ~/TortoiseBots-audit/RAID-PREP-aq40.md).
--
-- What the prep changed from the dungeongen draft (8 legs, 206 pull groups, 524 units, no approach points, no doors):
--   * 206 pull groups (524 units) become 159 (521 units, one entry per position). The three scripted units the draft had
--     in pulls (the Master's Eye 15963, the Beetle 15475, the Ouro Spawner 15957) and the C'Thun Portal 15896 and the six
--     friendly NPCs (15378/15379/15380, 15502/15503/15504) are in no pull and in every leg's skip list. Lone spawns chain
--     where they stand within 15 yd on one floor (|dz| <= 4) and the server walk between them is at most 2.2 times their
--     distance plus 8 yd, up to 16 units (the 40-man cap); a pull's reach (radius + 3) takes the lone spawns standing in
--     it; a patrol, a creature group or a boss never moves. Radius = the pack's own spread from its centre + 5 yd (at most
--     35).
--   * Legs follow the rooms and the temple's spiral: entrance (the upper terrace's eight Anubisath Sentinels and three
--     Obsidian Eradicators), skeram, silithid (the long descent to the Silithid Royalty's room: 18 packs, Vem/Kri/Yauj as
--     one boss step), sartura (her three royal guards and the area-trigger pull), fankriss (34 packs: the 146 Vekniss
--     Drones and 6 Vekniss Soldiers of the hive), viscidus (the boss alone), huhuran (20 packs of the wasp hive),
--     twins (51 packs: 100 Qiraji Scarabs, 113 Qiraji Scorpions and 5 Anubisath Defenders, then Vek'nilash and Vek'lor as
--     one boss step), cthun (22 packs of the corridor behind the Twins) and ouro (optional, last).
--   * The instance's own doors are waited on after the kill that opens them: 180636 (the gate above Skeram's room) after
--     Skeram, 180634 (the Twin Emperors' entry) after Huhuran, 180635 (their exit, to C'Thun's corridor) after the Twins
--     (instance_temple_of_ahnqiraj.cpp SetData; three wait_object rows, 60 s).
--   * Ouro (15517) has no spawn row. The Ouro Spawner (15957) at -9188 2092 -64 summons him (spell 26061) when a non-GM
--     player stands within 25 yd: the leg's last step is a hold on instance data 8 (TYPE_OURO, DONE on his death, a FAIL
--     respawns the spawner) with the party walked to a stand 20 yd from the spawner.
--   * Every pull and every boss but C'Thun carries an approach stand 12-21 yd from it on its own floor, reached by a
--     complete server path from the point before: 159 pull stands and 7 boss stands, so the run leader never walks toward
--     a pack it cannot see in hops of its own; 729 move rows cut the long walks between the legs and the packs.
--   * C'Thun's chamber is an island on map 531's navmesh: no server path reaches it from the Twins' exit corridor or from
--     the upper terrace (the corridor's last reachable point is z -25, the terrace's z 53-63), so the boss point is
--     marked needs_walk and its walk is the mapping walk's job (B2). C'Thun's phase 2 (the stomach, area triggers
--     4033/4034/4036) is a blocker beyond phase 1.
--
-- plan-check (turtle-agent plan-check --mmaps <map 531 mmaps>): 1 of 706 points fail (the needs_walk C'Thun boss), 1
-- run-leader hop (the same point), 38 warnings (37 "the patrol ... has only an estimated period_s" and 1 detour in the
-- Fankriss hive): the mapping walk (B2) measures the patrol rounds and finds C'Thun's ramp.
--
-- WHAT THE RUN LEADER CANNOT DO (nothing is dropped silently). Not in these rows: the entrance and teleports (the run
-- leader starts inside the instance), the level band, the raid size (no column), the leg skip lists, the 40 patrol blocks
-- (the run leader pulls the pack where it stands), needs_walk, and the boss tactics below where the kinds do not reach
-- (tank swaps, the Twins' teleport, C'Thun's stomach). Ouro's leg is a hold, the three doors are wait_object rows.

-- Dungeon plans for the run leader (.bot run), exported by turtle-agent (plan-export). Plan format v1; the mapping is
-- docs/guides/dungeon-run-leader.md ("From plan v1 to rows"). The plan file in turtle-agent is the single source: edit it
-- there and export again, never these rows by hand. The plan row carries the unit lists cc_priority, cc_always and kill_first
-- (columns from 20261015200000_world.sql). Never edit this file once applied; export a new one.
--
-- Idempotent: each plan's rows are deleted, then inserted. The tables come from 20261014150000_world.sql.

-- temple_of_ahnqiraj: map 531, 10 legs, 900 steps
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_step` WHERE `plan` = 'temple_of_ahnqiraj';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_leg` WHERE `plan` = 'temple_of_ahnqiraj';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_plan` WHERE `plan` = 'temple_of_ahnqiraj';

-- ai_dungeon_boss (map 531): the twelve boss entries' names from the core's creature_template (all rank 3), so the
-- dashboard crowns them. Ouro (15517) has no boss row (his leg ends in the spawner's hold) and is in this list all the same.
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_boss` WHERE `map` IN (531) AND `entry` IN (15263, 15544, 15511, 15543, 15516, 15510, 15299, 15509, 15275, 15276, 15727, 15517);

-- Boss tactics of Temple of Ahn'Qiraj, read from the boss scripts (the map has no creature_spells or EventAI rows for its
-- bosses) and the community's notes. Not one of the three kinds covers a tank swap, a teleport or a phase movement: those
-- stay with the bots' own raid strategies and the Raid Prep report's per-boss list.
--   Kri (15511): Cleave 19983 on the victim (boss_bug_trio.cpp UpdateAI) is a frontal; 10 yd is a judgement, the 1.12
--     Spell.dbc is not in this data set.
--   Yauj (15543): Heal 25807 on herself or a bug every 10-20 s (boss_bug_trio.cpp) is the fight's one cast worth an
--     interrupt.
--   Sartura (15516): Sundering Cleave 25174 on the victim every 3-4 s (boss_sartura.cpp) is a frontal.
--   Vek'lor (15276) and Vek'nilash (15275): each heals the other with Heal Brother 7393 within 60 yd every 1.5 s when the
--     brother is hurt (boss_twinemperors.cpp TryHealBrother).
--   Viscidus (15299): his first 0 % HP explodes him into glob 15667 (spell 25885); the globs that crawl back rejoin him
--     (25896), so they are killed first (the community's frost fight, inventory patch 324 focuses the same unit).
--   Ouro (15517): Sand Blast 26102 on the top-aggro player (boss_ouro.cpp UpdateAI) is a frontal cone.
DELETE FROM `ai_boss_tactic` WHERE `map` = 531 AND `boss_entry` IN (15511, 15543, 15516, 15275, 15276, 15299, 15517);
